# Terms that must never appear in a commit — one extended regex per line.
#
# This file is gitignored, and that is the point: a list of what must not leak
# would leak it. Copy it to .redact.local and fill it in as you go.
#
# Both `pwnloop audit` and the pre-commit hook refuse any staged or diffed line
# matching these, case-insensitively. Add a term the moment a run discovers it,
# not at release time — by release time you will not remember it.
#
# What belongs here:
#   - lab and machine names you are working on
#   - AD domains and hostnames discovered during a run
#   - the lab's internal IP ranges
#   - service-account names and any credential string worth guarding
#
# Examples (delete these; they match nothing real):
#   somelab\.vl
#   \bFILE0[0-9]\b
#   172\.16\.40\.
#   svc_[a-z_]+_t[0-9]
